        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: These Are Special Times, \"I Believe I Can Fly\"\n- People: R. Kelly\n- Companies: Sony Music Entertainment\n- Events: Grammy Awards\n- Topics: Christmas music, cover versions, original material\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, R. Kelly won three Grammy Awards for \"I Believe I Can Fly\".\n- On 30 October 1998, Sony Music Entertainment released These Are Special Times.\n- These Are Special Times features cover versions of popular Christmas tunes and original material.",
